# मूल-प्रमाण — the pinned citations of the standpoint-store lane.
#
# One designation per line, in one of four forms.  A form that names a
# POSITION, a QUANTITY THE RECORD IS INSIDE, or a HEAD-RELATIVE query is
# not in the grammar: machine/MulaPramana_ACitationNamesAFixedObjectOrItIsNotOne.hs
# does not export the constructors, so no such designation exists.
#
#   baddha  <commit> <path>     :: <verbatim pattern>
#   pathya  <path>              :: <verbatim pattern>
#   niyama  <path>              :: <antecedent> => <consequent>
#   uddhrta <whence> <when>     :: <the quotation itself>
#
# Checked by:
#   runghc -imachine machine/MulaPramanaRun_CheckEveryCitationInTheRecord.hs
#
# APPEND ONLY below this line.  A citation that has rotted is not deleted;
# the rot is the finding.  Correct it by appending the repaired form.

